    {
      "id": "u_348c408e908bd56a1511679d_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "There are generally two ways to display images side by side:",
      "sourceHash": "348c408e908bd56a1511679d49aa134e1f545ff8fabc28fa05f92905a359f679",
      "context": "Images > Aligning images side-by-side",
      "contextHash": "e6d104206776b6612d6c15a0970248fe76b3352620fd60cb6de3f8d06fde6af5",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "画像を横に並べて表示する方法には、主に次の2つがあります。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_2bc3217902f4c94f80a454b4_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "If they are roughly the same size, simply make the two images in-line, according to the alignment section above. The images can be dragged & dropped onto the same line.",
      "sourceHash": "2bc3217902f4c94f80a454b481243616263ea9839577b9066f07323faffeda1c",
      "context": "Images > Aligning images side-by-side",
      "contextHash": "e6d104206776b6612d6c15a0970248fe76b3352620fd60cb6de3f8d06fde6af5",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "画像のサイズがほぼ同じ場合は、上記の配置のセクションに従って、単に2つの画像をインラインにします。画像をドラッグ＆ドロップして同じ行に配置することができます。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_ef2e6166ce5a433c1c06364b_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "If they are on different size, create a __TRILIUM_PH_0__table__TRILIUM_PH_1__ with invisible borders.",
      "sourceHash": "ef2e6166ce5a433c1c06364b03debc5bc149a7fbd35ffd74db469aedef25e9fa",
      "context": "Images > Aligning images side-by-side",
      "contextHash": "e6d104206776b6612d6c15a0970248fe76b3352620fd60cb6de3f8d06fde6af5",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "サイズが異なる場合は、ボーダーの非表示な__TRILIUM_PH_0__テーブル__TRILIUM_PH_1__を作成します。",
